---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Terms of Use | PhotoEditingPrompt" desc="Terms for using the prompts on PhotoEditingPrompt.">
  <div class="narrow">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › Terms of Use</nav>
    <h1 class="page-title" style="font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,44px);margin:28px 0 20px">Terms of Use</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Last updated: 22 November 2026.</p>
      <p>By using {SITE.name} ({SITE.domain}) you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>
      <h2>Using the prompts</h2>
      <p>You may copy and use the prompts on this site for free, for personal or commercial photo edits. Please do not copy or republish the prompt library itself, in whole or in large part, on another website, app or paid product.</p>
      <h2>Use them on photos you have the right to edit</h2>
      <p>Only upload photos of yourself, or of people who have agreed to it. Do not use these prompts to make misleading, harmful, sexual or defamatory images of anyone, to impersonate a real person, or to create fake documents or identity photos.</p>
      <h2>Our content</h2>
      <p>The prompt text, page copy, design and example images on this site belong to {SITE.name} unless stated otherwise. The people in our example pictures are AI-generated models, not real people. Brand names such as ChatGPT, Gemini, Pinterest and Instagram belong to their owners, and this site is not affiliated with them.</p>
      <h2>No guarantee of results</h2>
      <p>AI tools give different results each time, and the tools themselves change. We cannot promise that a prompt will produce a particular image, and edited photos may not be accepted for official documents.</p>
      <h2>Third-party tools</h2>
      <p>ChatGPT and Gemini are run by other companies. Your use of them, including what they do with the photos you upload, is covered by their own terms and privacy policies.</p>
      <h2>Disclaimer and liability</h2>
      <p>The site and its prompts are provided "as is", without warranties of any kind. To the extent allowed by law, we are not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of the site or of images you create with the prompts.</p>
      <h2>Copyright complaints</h2>
      <p>If you believe something on this site infringes your copyright, email us the page address, what you believe is infringed and how to reach you. We will review it and remove content where appropriate.</p>
      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India.</p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms. The date at the top shows the latest version. Contact: <a class="link" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
